{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T07:37:59+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-10-29T07:37:59+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"Airbus SE","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Aerospace & Defense","country":"Netherlands","city":"Leiden","website":"https://www.airbus.com","employees":168754,"summary":"Airbus SE, together with its subsidiaries, engages in the design, manufacture, and delivery of aeronautics and aerospace products, services, and solutions worldwide. It operates through three segments: Airbus, Airbus Helicopters, and Airbus Defence and Space. The Airbus segment develops, manufactures, markets, and sells commercial jet passenger aircraft, freighter aircraft, regional turboprop aircraft, and aircraft components, as well as provides aircraft conversion and related services. The Airbus Helicopters segment develops, manufactures, markets, and sells civil and military helicopters; and provides uncrewed aerial systems and their related services. The Airbus Defence and Space segment designs, develops, delivers, and supports crewed and uncrewed military air systems and related services. This segment also offers civil and defence space systems for telecommunications, earth observations, navigation, and science and orbital systems; and services around data processing from platforms, secure communication, and cyber security. The company was formerly known as Airbus Group SE and changed its name to Airbus SE in April 2017. The company was incorporated in 1998 and is headquartered in Leiden, the Netherlands.","exchange":"Paris","currency":"EUR","financial_currency":"EUR","summary_fr":"Airbus SE, avec ses filiales, s'engage dans la conception, la fabrication et la livraison de produits, de services et de solutions aéronautiques et aérospatiales dans le monde entier. Elle opère sur trois segments : Airbus, Airbus Helicopters et Airbus Defence and Space. Le segment Airbus développe, fabrique, commercialise et vend des avions commerciaux de passagers à réaction, des avions cargo, des avions turbopropulseurs régionaux et des composants d'avions, ainsi que fournit des services de conversion d'avions et des services connexes. Le segment Airbus Helicopters développe, fabrique, commercialise et vend des hélicoptères civils et militaires, et fournit des systèmes aériens sans équipage et leurs services connexes. Le segment Airbus Defence and Space conçoit, développe, fournit et soutient les systèmes aériens militaires avec et sans équipage et les services connexes. Ce segment propose également des systèmes spatiaux civils et de défense pour les télécommunications, l'observation de la Terre, la navigation et les systèmes scientifiques et orbitaux; et des services autour du traitement des données à partir de plates-formes, de la communication sécurisée et de la cybersécurité. La société était auparavant connue sous le nom d’Airbus Group SE et a changé son nom en Airbus SE en avril 2017. La société a été constituée en 1998 et a son siège à Leiden, aux Pays-Bas."},"valuation":{"market_cap_yahoo":151900946432,"shares_outstanding":791480489,"trailing_pe":25.555258,"forward_pe":21.968512,"price_to_book":5.8707285,"ev_to_ebitda":17.008,"ev_to_revenue":1.989,"dividend_yield":0.0166,"payout_ratio":0.42610002,"beta_yahoo":0.887},"targets":{"current_price":191.92,"mean":231.20833,"median":240.0,"high":260.0,"low":183.0,"n_analysts":24,"reco_mean":1.79167,"reco_key":"buy"},"calendar":{"earnings_dates":["2026-10-28"],"eps_avg":2.93859,"eps_low":2.75578,"eps_high":3.09,"revenue_avg":29109446530,"ex_dividend":"2026-04-21","dividend_date":null},"holders":{"insiders_pct":0.25706,"institutions_pct":0.3784,"institutions_float_pct":0.50933,"institutions_n":720,"institutions":[],"funds":[],"insider_trades":[]},"estimates":[{"period":"0q","end_date":"2026-12-31","eps_avg":2.93859,"eps_low":2.75578,"eps_high":3.09,"eps_year_ago":2.92,"eps_n":3,"eps_growth":0.0064,"r